The hsm_psicc2 sample implements the statechart in Figure 2.11 of Practical
UML Statecharts in C/C++, 2nd Edition, by Miro Samek
(https://www.state-machine.com/psicc2). State Machine example copyright (c)
Miro Samek, used with permission of the author. The smf_calculator sample is
based on the statechart in Fig 2.18 of the same book.
